4 components, the ungated set.

| Component | Description | Options | Satisfies | Refuses |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `fedora-family` | dnf5 and its plugins, which every fedora build layer reaches for |  |  |  |
| `apps/browser` | A browser whose image entry sets the version | `OPT_LANG_VERSION="2"` `OPT_VERSION="128.0"` |  |  |
| `apps/editor` | An editor whose image entry leaves the version at its default | `OPT_VERSION="9.1"` |  |  |
| `apps/image-viewer@1` | A viewer imported under a local name, whose entry sits on one line | `OPT_VERSION="3.1"` |  |  |
